<title>USA: Cardinal Health sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Cardinal Health sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cardinal Health Inc said its board has approved a three-for-two stock split which will be distributed December 16, record December 2.</p>
<p>The company said its board also approved a 25 percent increase in its post-split cash dividend to $0.025 per share, payable January 15, record January 1.</p>
